Listen carefully, then say each word after me. Speak loud and clear!

5
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:20.426
Up!

6
00:00:21.326 --> 00:00:23.015
Up. Your turn!

7
00:00:25.915 --> 00:00:26.556
Up!

8
00:00:26.856 --> 00:00:27.509
Great!

9
00:00:28.517 --> 00:00:29.309
Down!

10
00:00:30.209 --> 00:00:32.188
Down. Your turn!

11
00:00:35.088 --> 00:00:35.984
Down!

12
00:00:36.284 --> 00:00:37.355
Wonderful!

13
00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.072
In!

14
00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:41.800
In. Your turn!

15
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:45.632
In!

16
00:00:45.932 --> 00:00:47.154
Super!

17
00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:48.919
Out!

18
00:00:49.819 --> 00:00:51.519
Out. Your turn!

19
00:00:54.419 --> 00:00:55.397
Out!

20
00:00:55.697 --> 00:00:56.733
Excellent!

21
00:00:57.717 --> 00:00:58.683
Under!

22
00:00:59.583 --> 00:01:01.330
Under. Your turn!

23
00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.103
Under!

24
00:01:05.403 --> 00:01:06.915
Well done!

25
00:01:07.917 --> 00:01:10.804
Up, Up! Down, Down! In, In!

26
00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.315
Out, Out! Under, Under!

27
00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:16.151
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

28
00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:19.382
Now say the whole sentence.

29
00:01:19.682 --> 00:01:21.345
The ball is under the chair.

30
00:01:22.145 --> 00:01:23.598
Your turn!

31
00:01:27.398 --> 00:01:29.665
The ball is under the chair.

32
00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.105
What is it? Can you say it?

33
00:01:36.005 --> 00:01:37.996
Down! Well done!

34
00:01:38.983 --> 00:01:41.415
What is it? Can you say it?

35
00:01:44.315 --> 00:01:46.004
In! Well done!

36
00:01:47.017 --> 00:01:48.343
Where is the ball?

37
00:01:51.843 --> 00:01:53.459
It is under the chair.

38
00:01:53.759 --> 00:01:54.911
Great speaking!

39
00:01:55.917 --> 00:02:00.917
Great job today, everyone! See you in the next unit. Bye-bye!

40
00:02:01.217 --> 00:02:02.543
